From b0f9c263b88539c62e895915fd4df77ee228ea88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ash Pera <ashley.pera@noaa.gov>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:44:53 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Noah-MP: take the latent heats from the host

Noah-MP charges the land its own latent heats (hvap = 2.5104e6,
hsub = 2.844e6, hfus = 0.3336e6 J/kg), while the atmosphere's moist energy
uses the host's (con_hvap = 2.5e6, con_hfus = 3.3358e5). With the water flux
now handed over directly (previous commit), the land paid more latent energy
than the vapour it released carries into the atmosphere.

hvap, hsub and hfus become module variables, with the old values as defaults,
in the soil and glacier modules, set at the start of noahmpdrv_run from its
con_hvap and con_hfus arguments (hsub = con_hvap + con_hfus). The run phase
already receives both, from the NUOPC land component and from CCPP alike, so
no interface changes. The WRF driver does not call noahmpdrv_run, so it keeps
the old values.

Port of the ufs-community/ccpp-physics fix (same code), measured in UFS
(C96 control_p8_ugwpv1, 24 h, all water fixes): the land paid +0.131 W/m2
per land column more latent energy than its vapour carries into the
atmosphere (0.41 % of the 31.8 W/m2 land latent heat flux, one-signed); with
the fix exactly 0. hvap and hsub enter the energy solution, so surface
temperatures, evaporation and melt shift slightly; the water closure itself
is unchanged. The ccpp-physics copy makes the same change. Related: NCAR/ccpp-physics#582.

Measured with the rest of this series in the land component
(datm_cdeps_lnd_gswp3, 24 h, a water meter in noahmpdrv_run): Noah-MP's
water-check residual summed over land points was -1.50 mm (-5.2e-4 of the
precipitation, one-signed) before the series and -2.3e-9 mm (-8e-13) after;
the metered original reproduces the regression baseline.

AI-assisted: written with Claude Code (Anthropic); reviewed by the author.
---
 drivers/ccpp/noahmpdrv.F90       | 10 ++++++++++
 src/module_sf_noahmp_glacier.F90 |  6 +++---
 src/module_sf_noahmplsm.F90      |  6 +++---
 3 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/ccpp/noahmpdrv.F90 b/drivers/ccpp/noahmpdrv.F90
index 3fc6571..fd86097 100644
--- a/drivers/ccpp/noahmpdrv.F90
+++ b/drivers/ccpp/noahmpdrv.F90
@@ -500,6 +500,8 @@ end subroutine noahmpdrv_timestep_init
 
   use module_sf_noahmplsm,   only : gfs_stability
   use module_sf_noahmp_glacier
+  use module_sf_noahmplsm,    only : hvap_lsm => hvap, hsub_lsm => hsub, hfus_lsm => hfus
+  use noahmp_glacier_globals, only : hvap_gla => hvap, hsub_gla => hsub, hfus_gla => hfus
   use noahmp_tables
 
   implicit none
@@ -988,6 +990,14 @@ end subroutine noahmpdrv_timestep_init
 !
 !  --- Just return if external land component is activated for two-way interaction
 !
+  ! the host's latent heats, so the land pays the latent energy its water carries in the atmosphere
+  hvap_lsm = con_hvap
+  hfus_lsm = con_hfus
+  hsub_lsm = con_hvap + con_hfus
+  hvap_gla = hvap_lsm
+  hfus_gla = hfus_lsm
+  hsub_gla = hsub_lsm
+
   if (cpllnd .and. cpllnd2atm) return
 
   do i = 1, im
